{"4595460":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Make the World Great Again","steam_appid":4595460,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5481e3ed7246e2d416db9eebd1573b5a.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/5481e3ed7246e2d416db9eebd1573b5a.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=326 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine there's a big, big, beautiful island where the elite meet, and every room, every piece of paper and every locked cabin hides something or someone they paid a great deal to bury. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just imagine. Or… you don't have to imagine, do you? A lot of people already know. Oh yes. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is evidence. <strong>Find it, and stop the evil.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5e7cdabcbfcfea6e7db483addbb1e81e.poster.avif?t=1793646354\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5e7cdabcbfcfea6e7db483addbb1e81e.webm?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5e7cdabcbfcfea6e7db483addbb1e81e.mp4?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5aa21e3ac8299362a04b59d65e0d12ae.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/5aa21e3ac8299362a04b59d65e0d12ae.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an agent. Board a boat into the dark and aim for an island only the elite are allowed to see. Frankly, we don't know what you'll find there. We can only imagine. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satellite shows that there is a house. Getting onto the island should be the easy part. The house is a different matter. Our intel says <strong>it's guarded, but we are not sure by whom or what.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/6a748c745b4af14d29e97097ed747d78.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/6a748c745b4af14d29e97097ed747d78.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=488 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/4f3a22d19a487ab11c9b2ed739c1683a.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/4f3a22d19a487ab11c9b2ed739c1683a.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered through the house are pieces of evidence only you can put in front of the world. Search every part of it. The dirtiest secrets are the ones they buried deepest. <strong>What an honest man would call fraud, they call projections.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not leave before the objective is complete. Try to still be breathing when you reach the last piece.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/1500504ccd4f6b7a5387a246156da157.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/1500504ccd4f6b7a5387a246156da157.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=488 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/3c9aab44f119e22ce36354d35f6b6b4b.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/3c9aab44f119e22ce36354d35f6b6b4b.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've lost people around these islands for years, and the paperwork always finds a reason. We believe some of them are still there. Satellite imagery shows small cabins near the main house. I bet you can find them there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go and look. Find a way in. It's optional. It costs you time you don't have. Nobody will thank you for it and the evidence still matters more. Welcome to politics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/f33c531d0d0c9d9853366fed4f8a8088.poster.avif?t=1793646354\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/f33c531d0d0c9d9853366fed4f8a8088.webm?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/f33c531d0d0c9d9853366fed4f8a8088.mp4?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/0600d9ef0bcc8cc2e40aa4b33f41d263.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/0600d9ef0bcc8cc2e40aa4b33f41d263.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once-in-a-lifetime experiences shouldn't go home empty-handed. There are collectibles hidden all over the island: the hat, the toy everyone used, the early operating system nobody should have.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The variety is broad. From wearables and consumables to… insert-ables (?).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/a0f7181111bf8889232fd9e59179bfc3.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/a0f7181111bf8889232fd9e59179bfc3.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=488 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/bed6615f55d049b605afd95ba7f27a27.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/bed6615f55d049b605afd95ba7f27a27.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have everything, run. Run, run, run. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a boat on the water. North side. The same one that's been bringing the guests in for years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one else to save. Not a single thing left to collect. Nothing to go back for. You just run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otherwise you're the one who needs saving.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/cfc5ff6f302c3a01866dd9a2dd233b63.poster.avif?t=1793646354\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/cfc5ff6f302c3a01866dd9a2dd233b63.webm?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/cfc5ff6f302c3a01866dd9a2dd233b63.mp4?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5481e3ed7246e2d416db9eebd1573b5a.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/5481e3ed7246e2d416db9eebd1573b5a.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=326 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine there's a big, big, beautiful island where the elite meet, and every room, every piece of paper and every locked cabin hides something or someone they paid a great deal to bury. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just imagine. Or… you don't have to imagine, do you? A lot of people already know. Oh yes. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is evidence. <strong>Find it, and stop the evil.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5e7cdabcbfcfea6e7db483addbb1e81e.poster.avif?t=1793646354\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5e7cdabcbfcfea6e7db483addbb1e81e.webm?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5e7cdabcbfcfea6e7db483addbb1e81e.mp4?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/5aa21e3ac8299362a04b59d65e0d12ae.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/5aa21e3ac8299362a04b59d65e0d12ae.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an agent. Board a boat into the dark and aim for an island only the elite are allowed to see. Frankly, we don't know what you'll find there. We can only imagine. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satellite shows that there is a house. Getting onto the island should be the easy part. The house is a different matter. Our intel says <strong>it's guarded, but we are not sure by whom or what.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/6a748c745b4af14d29e97097ed747d78.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/6a748c745b4af14d29e97097ed747d78.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=488 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/4f3a22d19a487ab11c9b2ed739c1683a.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/4f3a22d19a487ab11c9b2ed739c1683a.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered through the house are pieces of evidence only you can put in front of the world. Search every part of it. The dirtiest secrets are the ones they buried deepest. <strong>What an honest man would call fraud, they call projections.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not leave before the objective is complete. Try to still be breathing when you reach the last piece.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/1500504ccd4f6b7a5387a246156da157.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/1500504ccd4f6b7a5387a246156da157.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=488 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/3c9aab44f119e22ce36354d35f6b6b4b.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/3c9aab44f119e22ce36354d35f6b6b4b.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've lost people around these islands for years, and the paperwork always finds a reason. We believe some of them are still there. Satellite imagery shows small cabins near the main house. I bet you can find them there.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go and look. Find a way in. It's optional. It costs you time you don't have. Nobody will thank you for it and the evidence still matters more. Welcome to politics.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/f33c531d0d0c9d9853366fed4f8a8088.poster.avif?t=1793646354\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/f33c531d0d0c9d9853366fed4f8a8088.webm?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/f33c531d0d0c9d9853366fed4f8a8088.mp4?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/0600d9ef0bcc8cc2e40aa4b33f41d263.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/0600d9ef0bcc8cc2e40aa4b33f41d263.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once-in-a-lifetime experiences shouldn't go home empty-handed. There are collectibles hidden all over the island: the hat, the toy everyone used, the early operating system nobody should have.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The variety is broad. From wearables and consumables to… insert-ables (?).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/a0f7181111bf8889232fd9e59179bfc3.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/a0f7181111bf8889232fd9e59179bfc3.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=488 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/bed6615f55d049b605afd95ba7f27a27.avif?t=1793646354\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras_big\/bed6615f55d049b605afd95ba7f27a27.webp?t=1793646354 width=1560 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have everything, run. Run, run, run. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a boat on the water. North side. The same one that's been bringing the guests in for years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one else to save. Not a single thing left to collect. Nothing to go back for. You just run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otherwise you're the one who needs saving.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/cfc5ff6f302c3a01866dd9a2dd233b63.poster.avif?t=1793646354\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/cfc5ff6f302c3a01866dd9a2dd233b63.webm?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/extras\/cfc5ff6f302c3a01866dd9a2dd233b63.mp4?t=1793646354\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Infiltrate a private island where the elite meet, and every room, every piece of paper and every locked cabin hides something or someone they paid a great deal to bury. Uncover every secret and escape before they catch you.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/757604980199f48639ae6369abd0004d80259b97\/header.jpg?t=1793646354","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4595460\/9423cfcc1f36bd9b653bb7a0d89b2a4b1115c903\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793646354","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/